                                "example_id": "45ea3da2-76c9-48ad-925f-6338184ed231",
                                "sense_id": "b82ff821-c3e0-31aa-b43c-58bc8ef78ac7",
                                "text": "“My Continental prominence is improving,” I commented dryly. ¶ Von Lindowe cut at a furze bush with his silver-mounted rattan. ¶ “Quite so,” he said as dryly, his hand at his mustache. “I may say if your intentions were known your life would not be worth a curse.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "409c06ec-a320-41ef-bcf2-a66435a28a72",
                                "sense_id": "b82ff821-c3e0-31aa-b43c-58bc8ef78ac7",
                                "text": "The fly, named “Daptolestes leei,” has markings on its face reminiscent of Lee’s characteristic sunglasses and white mustache."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
